### Clear the single-line hotkey when the setting is absent

**Severity:** `high`

When an older settings object lacks the new property, this branch skips assignment and leaves `m_paste_as_single_line_hotkey` unchanged. A removed shortcut can remain registered after reload.

```suggestion
                        m_paste_as_single_line_hotkey = parse_single_hotkey(JSON_KEY_PASTE_AS_SINGLE_LINE_HOTKEY, settingsObject);
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        m_paste_as_single_line_hotkey = {};
                    }
```

**Verification:** Load a configured shortcut, then reload legacy settings without the property and confirm the old chord is cleared.
